1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,014
Want options? Raise
"Variations to generate".

2
00:00:05,214 --> 00:00:09,157
Each variation uses a
different random seed.

3
00:00:09,357 --> 00:00:11,371
Click "Generate".

4
00:00:16,571 --> 00:00:22,443
Click a candidate to write it into
REAPER. Switch as often as you like.

5
00:00:26,643 --> 00:00:29,871
Hover a candidate to see its seed.

6
00:00:30,071 --> 00:00:34,514
A greyed-out candidate
failed. Hover it to see why.

7
00:00:34,714 --> 00:00:39,729
Your pick stays until the next
generation. Undo removes it.
